                                "sense_id": "dffa06b4-4a6c-382a-a6aa-32ee328c8c50",
                                "text": "The Reds laid siege to the Albion goal throughout, with Jordan Henderson striking the underside of the bar and Dirk Kuyt the inside of the post."
                            }
                        ]
